    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631580/extras/449f22131969aab27bfcea17522acfd6.poster.avif?t=1728980195\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631580/extras/449f22131969aab27bfcea17522acfd6.webm?t=1728980195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631580/extras/449f22131969aab27bfcea17522acfd6.mp4?t=1728980195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Yee ha!</strong><br><br>The cats are hiding all over this western town! Can you find the all? Some cats are more hidden than others. Some rest on the rooftops, others inside buildings, while others in plain view. Keep an eye out for the hidden wanted posters, maybe the cat outlaws are lurking nearby!<br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83d\udc31100 Hidden cats</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83e\udd205 Hidden cat outlaws</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83d\udcdc5 Hidden wanted posters</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83d\udd0e10 Hints</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83c\udfdc\ufe0fHand-Drawn western town</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83d\ude38A lot of meowing sound effects</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83c\udfc6100 Achievements!</li></ul>",
